                    <div class="cx-music-item" data-src="https://pub-0b945c39f816498d833c1a7e27007410.r2.dev/%E9%97%AE%E4%BB%99%20(1).mp3">曲二: 问仙</div>
                    <div class="cx-music-item" data-src="https://pub-0b945c39f816498d833c1a7e27007410.r2.dev/一页皆知.wav">曲三: 一页皆知</div>
                    <div class="cx-music-item" data-src="https://pub-0b945c39f816498d833c1a7e27007410.r2.dev/唯心主义.wav">曲四: 唯心主义</div>
